                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I finally finished the game. I hated almost every moment of it. There are a lot of bugs, which can intefere with the precision needed for some of the platforming.\r\n\r\nThe visuals are nice. The music is nice in some scenes, but can soon get irritating.\r\n\r\nThe game lacks a story. A story would have been nice, and perhaps I would have appreciated the game a little more if there was a story to help explain the strange world.\r\n\r\nWhat annoys me most is the almost game-breaking bug in scene 12. This bug has been around for several years and has never been patched! Although it is still possible to complete scene 12 (by climbing the side of a building), this bug should have been patched long ago.\r\n\r\nOverall, a disappointing experience.",
